>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NORMATIVE-NAME-UNRANK.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ZERO.
   05 Z-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 Z-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-DUMMY-ZERO.
   05 DZ-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 DZ-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 DZ-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 DZ-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-A.
   05 A-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 A-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 A-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 A-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-B.
   05 B-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 B-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 B-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 B-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-OUT.
   05 O-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 O-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 O-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 O-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-R.
   05 R-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 R-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 R-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 R-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-BLOCK.
   05 BL-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 BL-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 BL-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 BL-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-N.
   05 N-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 N-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 N-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 N-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-REM.
   05 WS-REM-ID OCCURS 47 TIMES PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 WS-OP PIC X(16).
01 WS-SCALAR PIC S9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-SMALL PIC S9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-I PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-POS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CAND PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-REMAINING-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUFFIX PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FF-N PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FF-K PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-MASTER-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-K PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-RANK.
   05 LR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-COUNT.
   05 LC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-IDS.
   05 LK-ID OCCURS 47 TIMES PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-MASTER-COUNT LK-K LK-RANK LK-COUNT LK-IDS LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS
    SET Z-HEAD Z-TAIL DZ-HEAD DZ-TAIL TO NULL
    IF LK-K < 0 OR LK-K > LK-MASTER-COUNT OR LK-MASTER-COUNT > 47
        MOVE 100 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM FALLING-COUNT
    MOVE WS-N TO LK-COUNT
    IF LR-SIGN = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    MOVE LK-RANK TO WS-A MOVE WS-ZERO TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP <= 0 MOVE 101 TO LK-STATUS GOBACK END-IF
    MOVE LK-RANK TO WS-A MOVE WS-N TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP > 0 MOVE 101 TO LK-STATUS GOBACK END-IF

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > LK-MASTER-COUNT
        MOVE WS-I TO WS-REM-ID(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE LK-MASTER-COUNT TO WS-REMAINING-COUNT
    MOVE LK-RANK TO WS-R

    PERFORM VARYING WS-POS FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-POS > LK-K
        COMPUTE WS-SUFFIX = LK-K - WS-POS
        PERFORM VARYING WS-CAND FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-CAND > WS-REMAINING-COUNT
            COMPUTE WS-FF-N = WS-REMAINING-COUNT - 1
            MOVE WS-SUFFIX TO WS-FF-K
            PERFORM FALLING-COUNT-GENERIC
            MOVE WS-N TO WS-BLOCK
            MOVE WS-R TO WS-A MOVE WS-BLOCK TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
            IF WS-CMP > 0
                MOVE WS-R TO WS-A MOVE WS-BLOCK TO WS-B PERFORM SUB-A-B MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-R
            ELSE
                MOVE WS-REM-ID(WS-CAND) TO LK-ID(WS-POS)
                PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM WS-CAND BY 1 UNTIL WS-I >= WS-REMAINING-COUNT
                    MOVE WS-REM-ID(WS-I + 1) TO WS-REM-ID(WS-I)
                END-PERFORM
                SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-REMAINING-COUNT
                EXIT PERFORM
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.

FALLING-COUNT.
    MOVE LK-MASTER-COUNT TO WS-FF-N
    MOVE LK-K TO WS-FF-K
    PERFORM FALLING-COUNT-GENERIC.
FALLING-COUNT-GENERIC.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR
    PERFORM MAKE-SMALL-OUT
    MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-N
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I >= WS-FF-K
        COMPUTE WS-SCALAR = WS-FF-N - WS-I
        MOVE WS-N TO WS-A
        PERFORM MUL-SMALL-A
        MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-N
    END-PERFORM.

MAKE-SMALL-OUT.
    MOVE "FROM-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-ZERO WS-DUMMY-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
MUL-SMALL-A.
    MOVE "MUL-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
CMP-A-B.
    MOVE "CMP" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
SUB-A-B.
    MOVE "SUB" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
CHECK-STATUS.
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 AND LK-STATUS = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
END PROGRAM NORMATIVE-NAME-UNRANK.


