01 WS-TOTAL-COUNT-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RANK-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUM-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-COMB-A-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-COMB-B-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TERM-OWNED PIC 9 VALUE 0.
